  "body": "Welcome to 7 Ringi Lane, Orewa- a modern, easy-care home where thoughtful extras, fantastic outdoor living and a peaceful native bush outlook come together beautifully.\r\n\r\nHighlights you'll love:\r\n- Light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and living\r\n- Bonus butler's pantry with extra storage and prep space\r\n- Large outdoor entertaining deck with electric pull-down blinds\r\n- Peaceful native bush outlook\r\n- Flat, family and pet-friendly garden\r\n- Dedicated fitted laundry with additional cupboard storage\r\n- Garage plus extra off-street parking\r\n- WIFI-controlled ducted air conditioning\r\n- Double-glazed joinery\r\n- Privacy and block-out blinds\r\n- Modern, low-maintenance living\r\n\r\nDesigned with entertaining and everyday living in mind, the light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and living area connects effortlessly with the outdoors. The added bonus of a butler's pantry provides valuable extra storage and prep space, helping to keep the main kitchen tidy and clutter-free.\r\n\r\nStep outside and you'll discover one of the real highlights of the home - a large outdoor entertaining deck complete with electric pull-down blinds. Whether the wind picks up or a little rain rolls in, you can create a more sheltered space and continue enjoying the outdoors through more of the year.\r\n\r\nBeyond the deck, the lovely flat garden offers plenty of usable space for children and pets to play, while the peaceful native bush outlook creates a wonderful sense of privacy and calm.\r\n\r\nPracticality has been well considered too, with a dedicated fitted laundry and additional cupboard storage in the garage, along with extra off-street parking for family and visitors.\r\n\r\nYear-round comfort is taken care of with WIFI-controlled ducted air conditioning, double-glazed joinery and quality privacy and block-out blinds throughout.\r\n\r\nSet in a quiet, established Orewa neighbourhood, close to parks, schools and everyday amenities, this home offers a wonderful balance of modern comfort, easy-care living and space for the whole family to enjoy.\r\n\r\nComfortable, practical and beautifully positioned - 7 Ringi Lane is ready for you to simply move in and enjoy.",
